{{#with booking}}
<p class="greeting">Dear <strong>{{#if full_name}}{{full_name}}{{else}}Traveller{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p class="lead">
  Asante sana for travelling with <strong>Tanzania Safari Magic</strong>.
  We hope the dust of the tracks, the quiet of the crater rim, and the warmth of our guides stay with you long after you have flown home.
</p>

<p class="section-label">Journey completed</p>
<div class="data-card">
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Booking reference</span>
    <span class="value">#{{booking_reference}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Safari / package</span>
    <span class="value">{{package_name}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Travel date</span>
    <span class="value">{{formatDate start_date}}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box success">
  <strong>Share the magic — if you enjoyed your trip</strong><br>
  A short Google review helps fellow travellers find a trusted Arusha operator, and it means a great deal to our guides and camp teams who work so hard in the field.
</div>

<div class="cta-row">
  <a class="btn" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/36osoUgbeghcvwE89" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Leave a Google review</a>
  <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{#if site_url}}{{site_url}}{{else}}https://tanzaniasafarimagic.com{{/if}}/booking">Plan a return safari</a>
</div>

<p>If anything during your trip could have been better, please tell us privately — we treat every note as a chance to improve our hospitality.</p>

<p class="closing">Until the savannah calls you back — travel safely, and thank you for being our guest.</p>
{{/with}}